OL,3,GNEWSAMP calls for Yorkshire to get its
OL,4,Aown parliament
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Liberal Democrat MP has called on
OL,7,FPrime Minister Andy Burnham to go
OL,8,Ffurther with his devolution plans and
OL,9,Fgive Yorkshire its own parliament.
OL,11,FHarrogate and Knaresborough MP Tom
OL,12,FGordon said too much power was
OL,13,Fcurrently in the hands of elected
OL,14,Fmayors and a Yorkshire parliament would
OL,15,Fbetter reflect the region.
OL,17,FBurnham has recently set out plans to
OL,18,Fgive elected mayors more power over
OL,19,Fplanning and tackling fly-tipping and
OL,20,Fsaid he would give them a share of
OL,21,Fincome tax and business rates.
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
