OL,3,GNEWSAMP calls for Yorkshire to get its
OL,4,Aown parliament
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut Gordon told BBC Politics North he
OL,7,Fbelieved that giving more money and
OL,8,Fpowers to four separate Yorkshire
OL,9,Fmayoralties actually deepened divides
OL,10,Fin the county and a Yorkshire
OL,11,Fparliament would be "a good thing".
